Back-ported BSP Drivers
=======================

This directory contains drivers back-ported from upstream Linux.

Drivers from fbkernel 6.4
----------------------

Below 2 drivers are included Linux v6.4, but we have to "backport" them
to BSP folder because CONFIG_REGULATOR option is Not enabled in fbkernel
6.4.3-fbk1 (which leads to driver probe failures).

Driver List:
  * bp4a_lm90.c
  * bp4a_max1363.c

Backported from:
  * Repository: fbkernel
  * Branch    : release-v6.4-fbk1
  * Path      : drivers/hwmon/, drivers/iio/

Additional changes:
  * Added "bp4a_" prefix to filenames.
  * Added "bp4a_" prefix to of/id/driver table variables.
  * ignore devm_regulator_get_enable() error in probe() function.

Drivers from fbkernel release-v6.11-fbk3
----------------------------------------

ledtrig-timer.c
  * from drivers/leds/trigger
  * no logical change
